OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 40, dies after crash
OL,4,Ainvolving two motorcycles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 40-year-old man from Bridgend has
OL,7,Fdied following a collision between two
OL,8,Fmotorbikes.
OL,10,FIt happened on Harbour Way, Port
OL,11,FTalbot, on Saturday at about 14:15 BST.
OL,13,FHis family is being support by
OL,14,Fspecially trained officers, said South
OL,15,FWales Police.
OL,17,FThe force added the other rider
OL,18,Fsuffered minor injuries.
